cff-version: 1.2.0
title: 'Introduction to Computing: a six-week beginner course'
message: >-
  Please cite this lesson using the information in this file
  when you refer to it in publications or adapt it.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: Australian Data and Cyber Institute (ADCI)
abstract: >-
  A six-week, browser-only beginner course (6 hours per week or
  less) on computer hardware, data representation, operating
  systems, algorithms, networks, security, privacy and ethics. It
  prepares learners for computing study in cyber security or data
  science.
keywords:
  - computing
  - cyber security
  - data science
  - beginner
